blocks.en:
Figure 2 : Experimental setup. We systematically intervene on three components of the DINO-style training pipeline to isolate the factors responsible for semantic emergence:
(i) view generation to test the role of geometric displacement and instance identity;
(ii) training objective to distinguish the contribution of global instance alignment (semantic anchoring) vs. patch-level masked prediction (semantic refinement);
(iii) model capacity to study how scale amplifies representations without altering the learning mechanism.
All configurations are evaluated on classification and correspondence.

blocks.zh:
图2:实验设置. 我们系统地干预DINO式培训管道的三个组成部分,以隔离导致语义出现的因素:
(一) 查看生成以测试几何流离失所和实例身份的作用;
(二) 培训目标,以区分全球实例调整(语义定位)与补丁级遮掩预测(语义改进)的贡献;
(三) 研究规模如何在不改变学习机制的情况下放大表示的模型能力。
所有配置都通过分类和函授进行评估。
